{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 WndrCo, the investment firm led by Jeffrey Katzenberg, has made headlines by participating in a $5.5 million seed funding round for Idilio, a microdrama platform aimed at the Latin American market. This investment, which was announced on 4th June 2026, highlights WndrCo's continued interest in innovative content ventures that leverage }
{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 technology}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0
\ulnone\cf2  to reshape entertainment experiences.}{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Idilio, co-founded by Latin American media personality Gabriela Tafur and Esteban Ram rez, is positioned at the cutting edge of the microdrama trend, combining elements of popular Latin American telenovelas with the fast-paced world of vertical video. With the help of an AI-powered engine, Idilio claims to produce short-form drama series at a fraction of the cost and time compared to traditional methods, making it a disruptive force in the industry.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Since its launch just five months ago, Idilio has already achieved significant traction, boasting 1.5 million downloads across 93 countries. The platform has streamed an impressive 40 million episodes, with users reportedly consuming an average of 50 minutes of content daily\u8212 substantially higher than Netflix's typical engagement metrics. Tafur emphasized that Idilio was created to cater specifically to Spanish and Portuguese-speaking audiences, providing content tailored to their cultural context rather than merely translating existing formats.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 In addition to the funding, Idilio is set to introduce Idilio Creators, a program designed to empower microdrama makers by allowing them to monetize their content directly on the platform. Notably, 100% of the profits will be passed on to creators, reflecting Idilio's commitment to fostering a vibrant community of Latin American content producers. This initiative aims to tap into the growing demand for localized content while enabling creators to thrive in the competitive landscape of digital media.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Idilio's funding round included participation from other notable investors such as a16z Speedrun, Goodwater Capital, and Precursor Ventures, alongside prominent figures like David V lez from the fintech sector. With WndrCo's backing, Idilio is poised to make significant strides in transforming how microdrama is produced and consumed in Latin America, reinforcing the region's status as a hub for talent and innovation in the entertainment industry.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
