\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 SAN FRANCISCO--Netomi today announced a significant funding round of $110 million led by Accenture Ventures, with additional investments from Adobe Ventures, WndrCo, SLW, NAVER Ventures, Metis Strategy, and Fin Capital. This announcement was made on 6th May 2026, and it underscores Netomi's position as a leading enterprise-grade agentic customer experience (CX) platform, particularly in high-stakes environments where operational reliability is paramount.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 The funding will enable Netomi to accelerate its mission of embedding artificial intelligence (AI) into digital experiences across various sectors. Notable clients such as Delta Air Lines, United Airlines, MetLife, and Paramount are already leveraging Netomi's platform to enhance customer interactions through chat, email, and voice. Furthermore, the platform's integration within the United Airlines mobile app exemplifies its capabilities in real-world applications.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 As part of this funding round, Accenture has also formed a global alliance with Netomi aimed at developing a comprehensive playbook for enterprise agentic CX deployment. This collaboration is expected to empower Accenture's clients to leverage Netomi's }
{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 technology}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0
\ulnone\cf2  effectively, enhancing customer service with greater empathy, consistency, and intelligence. Ndidi Oteh, CEO of Accenture Song, emphasized the potential of agentic AI to transform customer experiences, stating, 'Netomi's platform strengthens the connection between people and the brands they trust.'}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Netomi's unique position is further validated by OpenAI's recent case study, which highlights its flawless track record in deploying agentic systems at scale without failures or regulatory breaches. This reliability positions Netomi as a frontrunner in the quest for AI-embedded solutions that dynamically adapt to customer journeys, enhancing overall satisfaction while minimizing friction. The platform aims to address the limitations of traditional customer experience }
{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 technologies}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0
