\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 As the demand for reliable, production-grade agentic AI continues to grow among enterprises, Netomi's funding round reflects a broader trend in the industry. The integration of AI within customer experience not only promises to reduce operational complexities but also enhances the ability of brands to deliver seamless, outcome-driven interactions. With a robust portfolio of clients and strategic partnerships, Netomi is poised to redefine the landscape of customer engagement in the coming years.}
