{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 The transaction was supported by a robust investor group, which includes notable global investors such as MassMutual and Sun Hung Kai & Co. Legal and financial advisement for the transaction was provided by leading firms across the industry, underscoring the significance of this deal for Janus Henderson and its stakeholders. As a result of this privatization, Janus Henderson is poised to strengthen its position in the competitive landscape of asset management.}
