\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 The rationale behind a16z Crypto's investment is rooted in the belief that privacy }{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 technology}
{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2  will serve as a crucial enabler for institutional adoption of blockchain. Historically, transparent ledgers have been touted as a significant advantage of public blockchains; however, this transparency is increasingly viewed as a liability by financial institutions, asset managers, and retail users who prefer their transactions to remain confidential. As a result, privacy-centric solutions like Canton are gaining traction, positioning themselves as viable alternatives for those wary of exposing their financial activities.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 The demand for privacy-focused cryptocurrencies has seen a notable uptick, with tokens such as Monero and Zcash experiencing substantial price increases over the past year. Monero has surged over 100%, while Zcash has seen remarkable gains of over 700% at its peak. Canton\u8217 s own token, CC, has also benefited from this trend, boasting a market capitalization exceeding $6.3 billion, making it the 15th largest cryptocurrency according to CoinMarketCap. Currently, CC trades at around $0.16, with a circulating supply of 38.8 billion tokens and no maximum supply cap.}
